{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/368","id":4723581106,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT8bGF88AAAABGYwgsg","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/368","diff_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/368.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/368.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/368","number":368,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Enforce standard skip-link focus in the final build","user":{"login":"arhancanli","id":315329124,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsuKZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315329124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The saved production standard returned `main#content` without `tabindex=\"-1\"`, and its skip link lacked the shared `skip-link` class. Synchronize those attributes in the committed page and check both the source and final `dist` output at the end of `postbuild`, so the same static target defect stops a build before publication. The generator already emits both attributes; the cause of the saved remote mismatch remains unproven.\n\nThe first signed head `4166b968` passed all eight new cases once in ROOT, the complete `6 + 1116 + 9` root suites, MCP suites `141 + 1 + 82 + 119 + 139`, and both postbuild checks on remote Node 22.23.3. Its CodeQL check failed with alert 91: deleting ignored comment/script/style spans can join surrounding text into a new tag. Original source, logs, alert, and independent source HOLD are retained.\n\nCurrent signed, clean head `76633be4f37422932f14af850d415f509ae01f8f` preserves ignored spans with equal-length whitespace and adds a split-tag regression with a positive control. Nine source-named cases are written; the existing new-head CI is their first runtime and is pending. No local project tests, build, browser run, or new live request has occurred.\n\nSix paths only: two HTML attributes, the bounded source/output guard, existing skip-link tests, one appended postbuild command, and append-only STATUS/LOG. The reader uses a regular opened descriptor, 2 MiB plus one overflow-byte cap, strict UTF-8, descriptor metadata checks and one close. This checks our generated static template; actual keyboard focus and a verified publication remain separate gates.\n\nSource manifest: `paper-mcp-discovery/source-76633be4-standard-skip-focus.json` in private coordination (SHA256 `5104e5f0a978b2411e48fbbda1844dde5140676a6710f0c9fd36c6a1d9c3edca`). Independent source and exact current CI review precede ordinary delivery. All owner objectives remain active.\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T02:50:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T03:05:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1745cbab5ab5537ca0e857c69d4a710bb226b732","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/368/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/368/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/ca